Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:05.76,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(629.083,434.61)\\fade(255,0,255,0,1100,5500,6900)}Episode 41\N \N\N\NSeizure of Four Commanderies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.80,0:00:05.60,Thinking,,0,0,0,,During the Battle of Nan Commandery,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.60,0:00:09.80,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang took advantage of the \Nbitter struggle between Zhou Yu and Cao Ren,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:12.64,Thinking,,0,0,0,,sending Zhao Yun to take \NNan Commandery by strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.64,0:00:19.32,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,He also used the captured military tally of Cao Ren \Nto seize Jing Province and Xiangyang in one move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:22.68,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Zhou Yu was so furious that his arrow wound broke open,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.68,0:00:26.64,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,he vomited blood, and fell from his horse, \Nswearing to recover Nan Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:31.24,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Lu Su, fearing that the conflict between \NSun and Liu would help Cao Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.24,0:00:34.32,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,went to Jing Province voluntarily to preserve relations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.52,0:00:36.44,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(962.047,492.273)}Zhūgé Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Lu Su, am a minister of Wu. \NMy visit is not because of our past relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.20,0:00:41.56,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(328.091,472.208)\\fade(255,0,255,0,420,3940,4340)}Lǔ Sù\NStyled: Zǐjìng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.08,0:00:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If I say anything offensive, please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.36,0:00:48.28,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(969.065,487.792)\\fade(255,0,255,0,420,2540,2900)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.84,0:00:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel free to say anything you wish to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}Both the Marquis of Wu and Commander Zhou have ordered me to greet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.36,0:01:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}In the past, Cao Cao led one million soldiers claiming to annex the Jiangnan region,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.16,0:01:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}but tried to capture you, Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}It was fortunate that our generals delivered a devastating blow to the Cao army.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.80,0:01:11.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}Thus, we saved you!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}Therefore, all the nine commanderies \Nof Jing Province belong to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.04,0:01:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}Now you robbed us \Nof Jing Province and Xiangyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}You had us Jiangdong waste our \Nwealth, provisions, and soldiers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.92,0:01:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}so that you may enjoy the benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.80,0:01:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}I fear this is unfair, in either justice or reason!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.64,0:01:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}Zijing, you are a very intelligent man, {\bord13.909}so why utter such words?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.72,0:01:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}There is a common saying: \N"An object eventually returns to its owner."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}The nine commanderies of Jing Province have never been your land;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.08,0:01:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}it was the foundation of Liu Jingsheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.96,0:01:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}My lord is akin to a younger brother of Jingsheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:02:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}Jingsheng may have died, but his son lives on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.12,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13}The uncle assists his nephew \Nby reclaiming Jing. What wrong is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.72,0:02:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are really occupying it for Noble Son Liu Qi, that is fair and just.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:25.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,However, he is far away \Nin Jiangxia and not in Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.60,0:02:27.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How do you explain that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.40,0:02:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, do you want to meet him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.12,0:02:51.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Invite the Noble Son in!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.72,0:03:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I am seriously ill so I was not able to greet you properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.80,0:03:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that you do not blame me, Zijing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I even dare to?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I am too ill, so I cannot stay here any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I must go, I must go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.40,0:03:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest, sir, and recover.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.60,0:03:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What I want to say might be improper.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.32,0:03:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no harm in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.16,0:03:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If the Noble Son is no longer here...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:47.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Noble Son's days are numbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.20,0:03:50.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Should he be gone, we will have \Na separate conversation for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Should he be gone, you must return the cities back to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.76,0:04:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Your words are correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.00,0:04:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.32,0:04:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, you are so foolish!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.68,0:04:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Liu Qi is in his prime. How can he die?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:22.96,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(287.75,455.065)\\fade(255,0,255,0,420,3580,3900)}Zhōu Yú\NStyled: Gōngjǐn
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If he does not die, then when\N will Jing Province be returned?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.92,0:04:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, please rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:29.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I assure you the return of Jing Province and Xiangyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And why are you so confident, Zijing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.76,0:04:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw that Liu Qi's face looked \Nvery ill, with his forehead being dark green.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.68,0:04:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He must have doomed his body with his addiction to debauchery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.40,0:04:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I reckon that he will die within half a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:49.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,At that time, I will demand Jing Province, \Nand Liu Bei and Zhuge Liang won't have an excuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.92,0:04:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And if Zhuge Liang gives another excuse\N for its delay at that time, what then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.60,0:04:58.32,Default,,0,0,0,,First, your arrow wound would have been completely healed,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:05:05.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and second, we can send out troops to conquer, and we have all the justification we need for the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Commander, our liege is besieging\N {\i1}Héféi{\i0} and remains unsuccessful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.84,0:05:15.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He orders that you join up \Nwith him with a detachment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He also asks you to rest and recuperate at Chaisang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.96,0:05:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}The west has the arduous terrain of Shǔ, the north has Cao Cao,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.96,0:05:40.16,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Shǔ (蜀) corresponds to modern Sichuan province
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.16,0:05:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}and the east has Sun Quan. We lack an enemy in-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.88,0:05:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}Only the south. It is weak and can be conquered.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.25,0:05:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)} Let us order Noble Son Liu Qi to recuperate,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909} but also petition for him to be Overseer of Jing Province to ease the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.16,0:05:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}We will then have a general remain to\N guard this land for the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.04,0:06:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}Afterwards, lead an army on a southern expedition, \Ntaking Changsha, Guiyang, Lingling, and Wuling,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.56,0:06:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}We can then collect resources to help us build a foundation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}Among those four commanderies, \Nwhich is to be taken first?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.40,0:06:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}To the west of the Xiang River,\N Lingling is the closest. It can be taken first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.48,0:06:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}Afterwards, take Wuling.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.72,0:06:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}To the east of the Xiang River,\N we can take Guiyang, and, finally, take Changsha.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.02,0:06:27.86,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(986.001,402.078)\\fade(255,0,255,0,420,2540,2900)}Línglíng \NCommandery
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.28,0:06:33.08,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei and Zhuge Liang led a great army on \Nan expedition southwards, taking Lingling first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.28,0:06:38.88,Thinking,,0,0,0,,When the Administrator of Lingling,\N Liu Du, heard of this, he surrendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.00,0:06:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lingling is ours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Who shall be the brave fellow to take Guiyang?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.24,0:06:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,\N-I wish to go! \N-I wish to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.52,0:06:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Zilong who responded first, \Nso let us send him off to Guiyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.66,0:06:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.98,0:07:00.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(287.75,476.883)\\fade(255,0,255,0,420,1789,1789)}Zhāng Fēi \NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.74,0:07:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You are biased, Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.38,0:07:08.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't need any help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.38,0:07:11.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I can lead three thousand men by myself and take that city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I also can do it with three thousand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.02,0:07:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Virtuous brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.98,0:07:24.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(998.498,515.845)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4420,4780)}Zhào Yún\NStyled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.22,0:07:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If we argue, I fear that it would hurt our bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.58,0:07:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better just to draw lots,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,to choose who goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.70,0:07:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.62,0:07:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, prepare paper and ink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.54,0:08:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Third Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.22,0:08:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.06,0:08:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever gets the one with\N a black dot will take Guiyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.58,0:08:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.78,0:08:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not fret, Yide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.06,0:08:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Although Guiyang is to be taken by Zhao Yun,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.06,0:08:57.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wuling still does not have \Nanyone to advance upon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.86,0:09:01.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General, do you want to take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.70,0:09:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Had I known, what reason would I have to argue?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How can an attack on a city be treated as child's play?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.94,0:09:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the two of you each take your cities, \Nyou must write a military pledge before departing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.26,0:09:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yes, sir! \N-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.38,0:09:30.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(986.001,402.078)\\fade(255,0,255,0,420,4220,4540)}Guìyáng \NCommandery
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.26,0:09:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator, if Liu Bei does invade, the two of us are willing to be the vanguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.66,0:09:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He is the Imperial Uncle,\Nand he has that crafty Zhuge Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.10,0:09:41.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(361.167,515.845)\\fade(255,0,255,0,420,4620,5020)}Zhào Fàn
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.44,0:09:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Both Guan Yu and Zhang Fei\N are foes equal to ten thousand men.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.82,0:09:45.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now the one leading the foray is Zhao Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:49.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,When he was at Changban, he charged \Nthrough thousands of cavalry like it was nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.30,0:09:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We have too few people and soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.82,0:09:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Better to... better to open the gates and surrender,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.10,0:10:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,to preserve the city \Nand save the people from warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.24,0:10:04.72,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(265.881,473.767)\\fade(255,0,255,0,0,2540,2900)}Bào Lóng
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.12,0:10:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to give our surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.92,0:10:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-Then do so. \N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,General Zhao!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.96,0:10:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Your surname is Zhao, and my surname is Zhao too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.68,0:10:56.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Five hundred years ago, \Nwe were in the same family!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.12,0:11:00.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General, you are from Zhending, \Nand I am from Zhending too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.76,0:11:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We are of the same ancestry and homeland!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.80,0:11:06.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If you are willing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.88,0:11:09.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,would you condescend to be my sworn brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:12.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It would be my great fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.08,0:11:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator, your intentions match with mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,-Men! \N-Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.28,0:11:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Bring offerings! \N-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.52,0:11:32.68,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(295.56,451.949)\\fade(255,0,255,0,420,4780,5140)}Lady Fán
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.28,0:11:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,-General, please! \N-Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.20,0:11:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,To Heaven above:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:50.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I, Zhao Zilong of Changshan, wish \Nto be sworn brothers with Administrator Zhao!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.40,0:11:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall share joy and woe,\N and aid each other through life and death!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.76,0:11:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Zhao Fan of Changshan, wish \Nto be sworn brothers with General Zhao!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.60,0:12:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We shall share joy and woe,\N and aid each other through life and death!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.48,0:12:17.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Such chances are rare. \NYou, being the older by four months,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:21.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,should naturally be the elder brother. Please accept my respects!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please! \N-Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.12,0:12:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please! \N-Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost my parents early on and I have no siblings.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.40,0:12:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I have met you, \Nworthy brother, I now have a new relative!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.24,0:12:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I had an older brother, he had passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.84,0:13:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I now view you, General, like my own elder brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.56,0:13:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.68,0:13:24.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General Zhao and I, being sworn brothers, are family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.40,0:13:26.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come! Quickly pour wine for General Zhao!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.24,0:13:32.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This General Zhao who frightened the\N Cao army at Changban slope is Zhao Zilong!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.36,0:13:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please sit, please sit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.56,0:13:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Younger Brother, who... who is this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my sister-in-law, Lady Fan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.52,0:14:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I did not know you would come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I neglected to pay my respects, \Nso please excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.72,0:14:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, why be so gentle? Come here! \NSit with us and partake in wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.72,0:14:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Our sister-in-law is here, so I dare not sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.12,0:14:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.88,0:14:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.32,0:15:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Younger Brother, why have \Nour sister-in-law raise a toast?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a reason for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.32,0:15:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My elder brother passed away three years ago leaving my sister-in-law a widow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.00,0:15:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I have often urged her to remarry, but she said that,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.40,0:15:23.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,only a man with three qualities can take her hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.24,0:15:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,First, he must be of fine scholarly conduct and warrior nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.84,0:15:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Second, he must look majestic \Nand have an outstanding presence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Third, he must share\N the surname of her late husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.88,0:15:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would have ever guessed\N that this world has such a coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.56,0:15:46.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You have a magnificent appearance,\N you are famous across Four Seas,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.24,0:15:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and you share the surname of her late husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.80,0:15:51.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You are the one she speaks of!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.60,0:15:56.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do not dislike her ugly appearance, I offer her to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.80,0:15:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,so that we can become family for generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.44,0:16:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that not marvelous?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.64,0:16:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That is blasphemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.72,0:16:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are sworn brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.88,0:16:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Your aunt-in-law is my aunt-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.80,0:16:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I do such an incestuous thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.76,0:16:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If you did not like it, you could just have told me directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.12,0:16:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why must you be so aggravated?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.44,0:16:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I am an upstanding man. How could I be a villain who takes advantage of beauty?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.64,0:16:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.00,0:16:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I treated you so well,\N but you had to be rude to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.00,0:16:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.84,0:16:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.44,0:16:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator Zhao was going to marry\Nhis sister-in-law to you. How marvelous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong, why must you be like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.16,0:17:04.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhao Fan and I swore to be brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.92,0:17:09.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Had I married his sister-in-law, that would\N invite universal ridicule! That is my first reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.16,0:17:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,For her to marry again would ruin her virtue. That is my second reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.36,0:17:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Zhao Fan has recently surrendered, and is suspicious. That is my third reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.76,0:17:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My liege has just arrived in \Nthe Jianghan Plains, which is not yet stable.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.24,0:17:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I ruin all your grand ambitions for one woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.96,0:17:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My task here is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.48,0:17:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The Strategos and I could be the matchmakers. Would you marry then?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.36,0:17:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Women are not rare in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.28,0:17:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I fear that I haven't established my reputation.\N Why should I worry about having no wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.72,0:17:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Zilong, you are a true man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Zhao Fan requests an audience. \N-Let him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.48,0:17:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.48,0:18:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle, Strategos, now that you have come to Guiyang, why do you not enter the city?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.36,0:18:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator Zhao, no need for politeness. We are busy with military matters, and so we cannot stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.80,0:18:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In the future, we will pay our respects to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.60,0:18:21.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Administrator Zhao, Zilong failed to accept your remarkable offer, as he has his own thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.40,0:18:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Please do not blame us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You shame me! You shame me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.44,0:18:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You, Zhao Fan, did surrender your city to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.60,0:18:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You may remain Administrator of Guiyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.32,0:18:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Imperial Uncle!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:50.96,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(989.126,395.845)\\fade(255,0,255,0,0,9000,9000)}Wǔlíng \NCommandery
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.56,0:18:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't anticipate the\N two of you coming here so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.40,0:18:53.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You only led three thousand soldiers to take Wuling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.76,0:18:56.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Strategos could not rest assured, so I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.96,0:18:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Never would I have guessed that Yide had already won!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.40,0:19:04.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Administrator and I didn't fight\N for too long as he fled after his defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.04,0:19:07.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This displeased Gong Zhi, \Nwho shot and killed him from the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.08,0:19:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I got everything without much effort!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Gong Zhi now?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.77,0:19:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Organizing old subordinates in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I still think we can make him the Administrator of Wuling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.72,0:19:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.72,0:19:26.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My liege, Zilong and Yide have \Ntaken two more commanderies.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.12,0:19:28.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yunchang fears he is just sitting in Jing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.56,0:19:34.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Once he gets news that the two commanderies were taken,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.28,0:19:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,he will certainly come to ask to take Changsha.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.44,0:19:41.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why must you trouble Second Brother so?\NI will head to Changsha tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.20,0:19:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,General Guan is here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.84,0:19:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother, you really know when to come!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.56,0:19:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,-Second Brother. \N-Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.08,0:19:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,-Strategos. \N-Yunchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.32,0:19:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother, hurry and sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Please. \N-Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.30,0:20:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.74,0:20:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You are not guarding Jing. Did you come for Wuling?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.22,0:20:11.90,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(978.192,480)\\fade(255,0,255,0,440,3340,3660)}Guān Yǔ\NStyled: Yúncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.90,0:20:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I came... I came to see everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.34,0:20:23.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't be hard on Second Brother! \NEvery man wants to perform great deeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.84,0:20:24.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Second Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.06,0:20:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You can be the one to attack Changsha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.78,0:20:37.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Strategos, Elder Brother, I hastened here overnight,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.50,0:20:39.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,to request to take over Changsha.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.03,0:20:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish to make up for my failure at Huarong Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.46,0:20:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that you will let me redeem myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.70,0:20:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,The problem is, the land of Jing is too critical \Nan area to leave without good generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.94,0:20:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's easy. I'll go replace Second Brother in his defense of Jing overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.30,0:21:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, Yunchang may attack Changsha.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.58,0:21:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, Elder Brother, when can I leave with my army to conquer it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.10,0:21:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang, you worked hard to rush here overnight. You should rest for a day or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.94,0:21:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,However, the conquest of Changsha is \Nof vital importance. Beware not to trivialize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.38,0:21:28.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Its Administrator, Han Xuan, is violent and rash by nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.82,0:21:33.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He kills without reason, earning the enmity of his people. But he is of no significance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.54,0:21:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He only has one great general, one from Nanyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.82,0:21:43.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,His name is {\i1}Huáng Zhōng,{\i0} styled{\i1} Hànshēng{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.74,0:21:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the General of the Household for Liu Biao.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.66,0:21:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, he guarded Changsha with Liu Biao's \Nnephew, Liu Pan, and then served Han Xuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.06,0:21:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Although he is over sixty years of age,\N he has incomparable courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.02,0:22:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Moreover, his generalship and tactics are exceptional.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.54,0:22:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When you leave, Yunchang, \Nyou must bring a large army.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.42,0:22:09.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Earlier, Zilong took Guiyang, and Yide took Wuling
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.66,0:22:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,with three thousand soldiers each.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang, you will lead ten thousand soldiers at this time. You must be very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.06,0:22:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Your concerns are unfounded. Huang Zhong is an elderly general.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.38,0:22:26.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I do not need ten thousand men.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.62,0:22:29.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I only need five hundred of my veteran warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.54,0:22:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The heads of Huang Zhong and Han Xuan\N shall be mine, and be presented in this tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.30,0:22:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, if Strategos is not assured, Second Brother and I will go together!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.08,0:22:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What can that old fellow do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.50,0:22:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother, you cannot act by impulse. You still-
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.54,0:23:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, be relieved. I must go now for this urgent military operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.86,0:23:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me see you off, Second Brother! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.62,0:23:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator, Guan Yu's army is only 5 {\i1}li{\i0} away!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.20,0:23:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I heard that this Guan Yu rode alone for over 1,000 {\i1}li,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.98,0:23:29.22,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(963.412,458.182)\\fade(255,0,255,0,420,2900,3220)}Hán Xuán
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.14,0:23:31.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and killed six generals through five passes.\NSuch god-like strength is incomparable!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.98,0:23:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My liege, no need to fret.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.78,0:23:38.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I only need this blade and bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.58,0:23:40.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(806.362,506.494)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3480,3900)}Huáng Zhōng\NStyled: Hànshēng
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.66,0:23:41.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A thousand of him come, and a thousand of him die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.38,0:23:42.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.90,0:23:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Elder general! Why must the Elder General go out?\NI, Yang Ling, shall capture Guan Yu alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.78,0:23:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Wei Yan, am also willing to go out!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.94,0:23:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You came here for refuge, \Nnot knowing that I already have strong generals.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.14,0:24:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not your turn to make meaningful contributions.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.42,0:24:02.74,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(295.56,511.169)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1900,2300)}Wèi Yán\NStyled: Wéncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.82,0:24:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,-Yang Ling! \N-Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.38,0:24:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead a thousand soldiers to engage the enemy outside!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.62,0:24:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.22,0:24:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Red-faced villain, you \Ndare invade our Changsha!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.02,0:24:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Yang Ling comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.34,0:24:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator, allow me to go outside and capture Guan Yu.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.90,0:24:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes... yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.14,0:25:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you none other than Huang Zhong?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.78,0:25:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing my name, how dare you invade my lands?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.10,0:25:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I came here just for your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.42,0:25:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.82,0:26:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I was about to capture Guan Yu. \NWhy did you call for my retreat?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.42,0:26:05.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,His martial skills are divine, \Nand you fought hard over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.06,0:26:07.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I feared that you would have exhausted yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.50,0:26:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. I will fight him again tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.78,0:26:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I will certainly take his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.06,0:26:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Guan Yu, come out of the formation now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.30,0:26:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us settle who dies here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.82,0:26:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.18,0:27:11.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}It will be hard to win without feints!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.66,0:27:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.58,0:27:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.62,0:27:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.54,0:27:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I will spare your life. Go get a new horse and fight again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.86,0:28:07.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General, why did you fall from your horse so abruptly?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.38,0:28:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The horse has not been in battle \Nfor a long time, so it stumbled.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.90,0:28:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,-Men. \N-Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.14,0:28:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring my blue-maned horse \Nand give it to the elder general.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.82,0:28:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.74,0:28:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.10,0:28:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Your archery skills are excellent, never erring.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.90,0:28:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not shoot him?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.50,0:28:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you are right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.78,0:28:44.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I will feign defeat in tomorrow's battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.74,0:28:50.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,to lure him to the drawbridge, where I will shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.98,0:29:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You are fighting tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.90,0:29:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, why are you drinking sour wine alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.78,0:29:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you, Wenchang. Come, sit there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.34,0:29:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I watched the battle carefully, \Nso I know why you are so stressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.94,0:29:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenchang,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.54,0:29:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,it is rare that one like \NGuan Yunchang is so righteous.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.50,0:29:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He does not want to kill me,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.06,0:29:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,so how could I shoot him?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.70,0:29:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,However, if I do not shoot him, that \Nwill violate the Administrator's order.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.90,0:30:08.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Elder General, Han Xuan is just \Na violent and impulsive villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.98,0:30:10.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why bother toiling for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.54,0:30:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenchang,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.82,0:30:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,it is often said that just as a faithful wife marries one husband, a loyal subject serves one master.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.78,0:30:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not say such nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.30,0:30:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.10,0:30:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,when two tigers fight, one will certainly end up injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.70,0:30:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you will think thrice about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.22,0:31:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you not shooting? What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.50,0:31:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}Huang Hansheng can hit\N poplar leaves from a hundred paces,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.18,0:31:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}but he has only hit my helmet's tassel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.32,0:31:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}He is paying back my mercy from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.50,0:31:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}Honorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.10,0:32:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tie him up for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.26,0:32:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.82,0:32:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.18,0:32:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I am innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.02,0:32:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am innocent!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.42,0:32:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}I watched you fight for three days.\N You think you can trick me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.14,0:32:24.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}You weren't fighting your best two days ago; \Nsurely because of your selfishness!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.58,0:32:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}Your horse stumbled yesterday, \Nbut he did not kill you! You must be in cahoots!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.30,0:32:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}Today, you made two "shots,"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.94,0:32:37.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}and the third one only hit his helmet's tassel!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.66,0:32:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13\pos(640,670)}This is proof you are collaborating with the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.06,0:32:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Administrator, you-!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.50,0:32:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}If I do not execute you,\N you will become trouble in the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.54,0:32:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}-Executioners! \N-Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.98,0:32:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Take him outside and show his head to the public!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.46,0:32:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.86,0:32:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Huang Zhong, as a servant of the Hàn Dynasty,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.86,0:33:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,will die without regrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.22,0:33:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Please show mercy, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.92,0:33:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever begs for mercy joins that old traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.36,0:33:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Off with his head!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.68,0:33:22.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sir, Huang Hansheng is the defense of Changsha.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.88,0:33:25.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,To kill him now is to kill the entire city!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.00,0:33:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.24,0:33:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Men, arrest this treacherous Wei Yan!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.68,0:33:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.68,0:33:36.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Generals, Han Xuan is a brutish \Nand wicked man who disparages talented people.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.80,0:33:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He ought to be killed!\NCome with you want to join me!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.08,0:33:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Wenchang, do not do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.48,0:33:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Lower the drawbridge, open the\N city gates, and invite General Guan in!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.88,0:33:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.32,0:33:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,My respects, Imperial Uncle and Mister Zhuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.68,0:34:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,General Wei, please rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.08,0:34:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My thanks, Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.60,0:34:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, Strategos, this General Wei \Nkilled Han Xuan and surrendered the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.96,0:34:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He led troops to rescue General Huang as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.52,0:34:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.92,0:34:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-Men. \N-Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.24,0:34:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrest Wei Yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.08,0:34:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.16,0:34:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wei Yan has done good deeds. \NWhy are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.20,0:34:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}He killed his lord, from whom he received his salary. That is disloyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.08,0:34:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}He surrendered his city, in which he resided. That is wicked.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.28,0:34:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}Being such a wicked, disloyal and impulsive man, how can he serve us?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.28,0:34:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord13.909}Execute him now before\N he becomes trouble in the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.32,0:34:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.08,0:34:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, you cannot do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.16,0:35:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you kill him, I fear the people who surrendered will feel endangered.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.32,0:35:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope that you may pardon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.44,0:35:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not ever become impetuous under our liege.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.16,0:35:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,If you fail this, I will easily take your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.12,0:35:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.56,0:36:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yunchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.72,0:36:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, General Huang not only possesses extraordinary courage,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.28,0:36:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but his loyalty \Nand sense of duty is peerless.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.36,0:36:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since Changsha fell, he has shut himself \Nin his home and refuses any visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.08,0:36:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time I called for him\N so I could pay my respects, he refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.88,0:36:43.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He only sent out his family to say that he is ashamed to be a surrendered general.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.68,0:36:57.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What a loyal and righteous gentleman!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.80,0:37:00.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We can only have our lord visit him in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.56,0:37:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Madam, what is Elder General Huang doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.68,0:37:41.36,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(293.999,403.636)\\fade(255,0,255,0,400,42600,4660)}Lady Huáng
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.56,0:37:42.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever since Changsha fell, he has been like that, daily.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.52,0:37:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He has been saying that he is ashamed to face Heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.72,0:37:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Huang!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.20,0:38:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Huang!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.28,0:38:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Huang!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.52,0:38:28.32,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,Huang Zhong, through the sincere requests of Liu Bei, Zhuge Liang, and the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.32,0:38:30.04,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,submitted at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.68,0:38:34.36,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Liu Bei hence gained another major general.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.32,0:38:41.08,Thinking,,0,0,0,,By capturing Lingling, Wuling, Guiyang, and Changsha,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.48,0:38:46.44,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang exploited Cao Cao's inability to go south due to his defeat at Chibi,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.96,0:38:50.40,Thinking,,0,0,0,,and Sun Quan besieging Hefei with all his strength,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.00,0:38:57.04,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,executed his strategic plan to expand southwards, achieving complete success.

